{"id":"c36828ce471a79d1","group":"28","path":"28/28-cor-l-strict-pspace.md","title":"L严格包含于PSPACE","display":"cor-l-strict-pspace — L严格包含于PSPACE","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-cor-l-strict-pspace","aliases":["28-cor-l-strict-pspace"],"display":"cor-l-strict-pspace — L严格包含于PSPACE","depends_on":["[[28-df-l]]","[[28-df-pspace]]","[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.8; local consequence","source_printed_pages":"82","source_pdf_pages":"108","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-cor-l-strict-pspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-cor-l-strict-pspace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-l-strict-pspace — L严格包含于PSPACE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6fe48e4cc479f3fd\" href=\"?note=6fe48e4cc479f3fd\" title=\"28-thm-space-hierarchy\">28-thm-space-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.8; local consequence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"108"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L,\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf L,\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span> 见所列定义；空间层级定理采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6fe48e4cc479f3fd\" href=\"?note=6fe48e4cc479f3fd\" title=\"28-thm-space-hierarchy\">28-thm-space-hierarchy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\\subsetneq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf L\\subsetneq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>log(n+2)=o(n+2)，两界空间可构造；空间层级定理给出DSPACE(log(n+2))⊊DSPACE(n+2)，后者包含于PSPACE。该推论没有重新证明一般空间层级定理，故保留依赖原定理的证据边界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 4.8; local consequence；印刷 pp.82 / PDF pp.108。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-l]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-space-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"6fe48e4cc479f3fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-space-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"6fe48e4cc479f3fd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L,\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见所列定义；空间层级定理采用 [[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L,\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf L\\subsetneq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.","display":true}],"bytes":1289,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-conl]]、[[28-prop-nl-contained-p]]、[[28-cor-l-strict-pspace]]、[[28-df-savitch-reachability]]、[[28-prop-finite-reachability-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["e145640be927aa76","fd829148f31abddc","6fe48e4cc479f3fd"]}